26   Non-self-priming, single-stage, centrifugal pump                     000017
26   designed according to ISO 5199 with dimensions and                   000018
26   rated performance according to EN 733. Flanges are PN                000019
26   16 with dimensions according to EN 1092-2. The pump                  000020
26   has an axial suction port, a radial discharge port and               000021
26   horizontal shaft. It is of the back pull-out design                  000022
26   enabling removal of the motor, coupling, bearing                     000023
26   bracket and impeller without disturbing the pump                     000024
26   housing or pipework.                                                 000025
26   The unbalanced rubber bellows seal is according to DIN               000026
26   EN 12756.                                                            000027
26   The pump is fitted with a foot-mounted, fan-cooled                   000028
26   asynchronous motor. Pump and motor are mounted on a                  000029
26   common base frame.                                                   000030
